; icons (docs/ART.md 11.5): line-and-mass glyphs in bone 7/6 with one accent colour and a void
; outline (invisible on soot panels, a contrast edge over the map). icon16/ for panels and the top
; bar, icon8/ inline in text and on map tiles. Names follow the game's [ICON_*] keys (food,
; production, commerce, gold, research, culture, espionage, happy, unhappy, healthy, unhealthy,
; greatpeople, strength, moves, defense, angrypop, bullet) plus the empire marks of the top bar.
; Category fallbacks (names starting with _) are recoloured by the mapping (`remap=`).

